<div class="kapi-error" data-kapi-preset="kv" role="alert" data-kapi-id="k0000005"><span class="kapi-error-tag">&lt;kapi-kv&gt;</span> holds only &lt;kapi-item&gt; children; move the text "loose text" into one</div>
